; 03-multi-file.rye - verify that Loading a sibling file works inside the jail
; Run: rye -unshare 03-multi-file.rye
;
; The filesystem jail bind-mounts the current directory as /app.
; If Load % works, the CWD bind-mount and Rye's file resolver are both correct.

print "=== Multi-file Load test ==="

Load %helper.rye

greet "sandbox"

print "=== done ==="
